    {
      "uid": "zhcn:77d4d861f9129e341823158c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她与训练员心情很好地\n前往札幌观光。",
      "source_fingerprint": "689c036a2c44679603be2a9748d78195c390d4215332d2e2cdc5849c27c8776a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1056/storytimeline_501056431.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:21a4a51cde7df20f66aff478",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "当他们经过“时钟台”前时，\n指针正好指着南方。\n位于那个方向的是千叶的“中山赛场”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f05e21afd1e002e6bd56e3d00dbf9f1c44ee5017520646c6aa90af7c1b311a7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1056/storytimeline_501056431.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:65ccd323be086cfeb4ca532d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "认为这是个启示的待兼福来，\n向训练员提出了想参加\n“有马纪念”的要求。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ee437d6e3844e76c9618463753434e20c859d67de8e57ffbaf3811b95b472cac",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1056/storytimeline_501056431.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d0e492d849712f85b6ae4bc8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不是像“宝冢纪念”时那样依靠外力，\n而是以自己的力量累积票数后参赛……\n为此，待兼福来充满了斗志。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1f58dbdd70a91f1826c3e1772ffa24a769c67bfc7b722c2727407ee2aa2adea0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1056/storytimeline_501056431.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:66f971452c043f744fc6d755",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "札幌纪念结束后・即使没有三只眼",
      "source_fingerprint": "6fdf9a0b66a7c999e3e832c420ef365f8efea013377153bbe541bdd8c0de06d3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1056/storytimeline_501056431.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b201d709fbf295c1e0a3621",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在远处都听得到的巨大欢呼声鼓励下，\n待兼福来称霸了“有马纪念”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6c5adb090413dd8a886d388e67caf893b1af360d36d2198093d481fa5ac71ffe",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1056/storytimeline_501056432.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b209319f7ba39ff540eb4b0c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她已经不再只会依赖运气奔跑。\n虽然成就感让她几乎快晕过去，\n她还是前去接受胜利者访谈。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e7d8a2097dc039f931116bad055ca2009d2dca89bb349c52fcf085c4cdc66112",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1056/storytimeline_501056432.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5691fa5558c9fe8b9d09e171",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "待兼福来在那里表示，只要心怀愿望，\n无论是谁都能获得幸福，\n然后──",
      "source_fingerprint": "53fec91feeeb14626041f07b2fb7bd09c5fcc6eaec7f3a9187e898e721ef5f0f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1056/storytimeline_501056432.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:29b3a9baa2bdd4e83fe58b32",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她也高声宣布\n自己今后会继续跑给粉丝们看，\n让大家都获得幸福。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ca86afbeded60e08734d08b1782793786af85fa87a33e0c196aee95b6811d684",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1056/storytimeline_501056432.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9be6e4f5b00a90b103735afb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "有马纪念结束后・福来今至",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea0017383804b7a18b1ecdc71118969651342cdb6e563f3d6f541576afdde0f3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1056/storytimeline_501056432.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:101c97aefb15da673fed8a80",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "某个假日，\n当我正悠哉地在房间里吃早餐时……",
      "source_fingerprint": "325b065a288b1b3fb6a37fad7361f656b56ffb3535cc27801cc72c23b1230cfe",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1056/storytimeline_501056500.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3a4ec0a720ff996dc5e85922",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "待兼福来",
